{"ref":"BDB, רַ֫הַב","hw":"רַ֫הַב","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רַ֫הַב</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] lit. <strong>storm, arrogance</strong>, but only as names, v. infr.;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.7\">Is 30:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רָ֑הַב</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 9:13\" href=\"/Job.9.13\">Jb 9:13</a> +;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  mythical sea monster (cf. Barton <sup>JAOS xv. 1 (1891), 22 f.</sup>): <span dir=\"rtl\">עֹזְרֵי ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 9:13\" href=\"/Job.9.13\">Jb 9:13</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 26:12\" href=\"/Job.26.12\">26:12</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּנִּין</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.9\">Is 51:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:11\" href=\"/Psalms.89.11\">ψ 89:11</a><br><strong>2.</strong>  emblemat. name of Egypt, <span dir=\"rtl\">רַהַב וּבָבֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 87:4\" href=\"/Psalms.87.4\">ψ 87:4</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מצרים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.7\">Is 30:7</a>.","next":"BDB, מַרְהֵבָה","prev":"BDB, רֹ֫הַב"}